WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.650
Someone once said...

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:53.150
There is a beach that has all the 
rice balls you could ever eat,

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:59.530
filled with naturally seasoned 
seaweed, beefsteak plant, and egg...

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:03.630
Rice Ball Beach!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:09.540
And when they're in season, there are 
thick leaves whose texture changes

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.940
to a mousse-like velvety smoothness, 
and the flavor of every fruit

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:16.110
can be tasted in their fronds...

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.050
Bavari-aloean Cream!

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.080
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:28.020
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.830
Toriko and Komatsu are determined to 
locate the legendary Century Soup,

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.900
which only appears once every 100 years.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.630
Gourmet industrialist 
Colonel Mokkoi has asked

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.600
Toriko,

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:42.740
Match,

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:43.740
Takimaru,

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.840
and other tough Gourmet Hunters

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:50.040
to find the soup, for which he'll 
pay a reward of 100 billion yen.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.710
The Gourmet Hunters board the icebreaker

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.950
and set off for the frigid 
continent known as Ice Hell,

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.090
homeland of the Century Soup.

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:03.120
Tina, who got wind of the information,

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.920
stowed aboard the ship 
in order to get a scoop.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.400
3-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.470
Toriko and the other hunters drove back

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.440
the savage sea creatures that 
attacked the icebreaker,

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.810
only to have a new peril befall them!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:35.850
Challenge of the Gourmet Hunter 
Army! Disembarking at Freezing Hell!

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.900
A giant ball of ice!

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.310
It's not even putting a dent in it!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.610
Run!

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.150
C-Computer graphics!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.590
It's gotta just be computer graphics!

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:11.320
Match-san!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:17.790
Toriko-san!!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.200
Don't panic.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.900
Everyone, get back!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.200
Toriko-san!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.800
What's he gonna do?!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.640
Flying Knife!

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.180
Flying Fork!

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.990
Time for one more push...

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.420
5-fold...

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.560
Spiked Punch!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.550
What happened?

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:14.720
He split the ice ball!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.790
Flying Knife and Flying Fork...

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.160
They should have been more 
powerful than before...

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.760
But I guess I'm still not strong enough...

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:31.200
Still, my opponent is just ice.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.500
The BB Corn was tougher than this.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.700
Toriko-san!

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.370
Toriko-san! Toriko-san!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.940
Wow. Only Toriko-san could've done that...

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.510
His power is amazing...

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:49.820
Toriko... I'd never be able to 
find a more reliable partner

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.780
Toriko-san, you really are incredible!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.790
for the challenge that lies ahead.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:57.690
Although it's possible we'll 
fight over the Soup in the end...

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:01.830
I'd better be prepared to battle...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:09.640
And now, I'll take you gentlemen near 
the summit of the ice via helicopter.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:13.240
But you'll have to climb the rest 
of the way under your own power.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.440
There's a certain reason 
airplanes or helicopters

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.140
can't make it to the top of Ice Hell.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.250
You'll find out what it 
is once you get there.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:24.550
We already have much fewer people 
with us than when we started out.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.080
There's only one helicopter,

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.450
but if you split up into two groups,

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.950
we should easily be able 
to get everyone on board.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.860
Get ready to go!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.960
I'll take the second trip up!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:38.860
I wanna pack as much food 
as I can in the meantime!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:40.430
Come on, Komatsu.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.370
We'll be in the first group.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.100
Sure!

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.310
What, you're going up there too?

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:49.770
You've got guts.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.880
Well, shucks...

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:09.890
Our client, the Colonel, 
has a lot of courage.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:12.960
I mean, for coming with us to 
even the most dangerous area...

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:17.170
Didn't you know? You saw all the 
black suits around him, right?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.340
They're the Gourmet SP...

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.810
Masters of the fighting 
arts from around the world,

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.080
gathered to become elite bodyguards...

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.710
I see. So the Colonel can even 
come to a place like this

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:34.680
without worrying about creatures attacking...

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.190
He ain't here.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.350
I say the Colonel ain't here.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:42.160
You saw him yourself, right 
there on the icebreaker with us!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.630
What the hell are you talkin' about?!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:48.360
What do you mean...

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.100
the Colonel isn't with us?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.500
What is it, Kuruppo?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.040
This time, I'm bringing 
home a scoop for sure!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.180
So I can't take my eyes off of Toriko!

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.110
Why are you being so pesty?!

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.310
Gong...

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:07.520
Tonbi!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.020
Or was it Abura-age...?

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.990
You're sayin' that on purpose! 
You always call me Zombie!

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.260
And if you're on the lookout, 
you're doin' a lousy job!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.390
Hah?

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:19.830
You wanna get footage of me the moment 
I set foot on Ice Hell, right?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.360
No, there's not even 1 gram 
of news value in that...

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:26.070
And you mean to enter Ice Hell wearing that?!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.410
You cold-sensitive pansies are pathetic!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.740
What, do you all get the chills?!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.880
This is a whole different league of cold!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.350
You'll turn into a popsicle!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:45.150
Even in role-playing games, I'm 
the type of guy that "levels up"

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:48.920
and sets out on a quest before 
getting his equipment together.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.060
I'm freezing!

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.700
Zonge-sama!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.230
What did I tell you? Here...

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.630
Climb up the rest of the way yourselves!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.870
The chopper can't get any closer 
'cause of the strong winds!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.940
I'm going back to pick up the second team!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.290
Are you one of them?

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.020
You're wasting your time.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.630
I'm not even here.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.660
You should go back and get the soup.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.500
I don't care who finds it.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.030
I'll gladly pay every yen I promised.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.350
We finally made it!

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.360
Wow, Toriko-san! We're the 
first ones to the top!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.860
Freezing!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.530
Hey!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.900
Takimaru! Hurry up!

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.740
O-Okay! I'm almost there!

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:07.220
T-Toriko-san... In front of you...

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.300
Please look in front of you! Toriko-san!!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:21.070
It's the gatekeeper of the ice 
world that freezes everything...

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.370
The Tundra Dragon!!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.870
It's frozen?

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.500
How is it that the gatekeeper 
of the ice world is frozen?!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:57.570
Toriko-san!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:04.010
What is this?!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.580
Gourmet Hunters...

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.050
Gourmet Hunters who came here 
in the past and were all frozen!

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.820
Even though this is just the 
entrance to the continent...

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:15.890
This literally is Ice Hell!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.790
Has something happened?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.100
A Tundra Dragon!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:26.130
Takimaru! You better get fired up!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:29.340
This continent can't be conquered 
by anybody who's lukewarm!

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.250
Second group, get aboard! I'm gonna lift off!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.130
The Gourmet Corp., eh?

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.800
That's fine, too...

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:12.040
I owe you for sharing your Lighter Suit,

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.480
but I didn't figure you were this heavy...

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.720
P-Please don't drop me here!

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.360
W-Where's Toriko?

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.000
What is that?!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.030
Don't ask me!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:41.610
It's the gatekeeper of the ice world...

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:43.370
a Tundra Dragon!

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:49.310
B-But it's... frozen solid...

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.520
Darn it! That was no good!

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.220
This wind is too strong...

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.990
I think I'm gonna freeze to death, 
even wearing this Lighter Suit!

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.960
This wind...

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:02.190
It seems this peculiarly strong 
wind freezes everything...

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:07.830
Guess the chopper couldn't get us any 
closer 'cause of this typhoon-like wind!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:12.470
We'd better stick together and move 
as a group, right, Toriko-san?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:15.440
Yeah... I'll take the lead.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:17.610
Everyone, follow me!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.710
Zonge-sama, what should we do?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.850
Hmph! Do I even have to tell you?

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:24.980
We take the easiest route...

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.620
But it turns out to be the hardest one...

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.220
Except it only looks that way and 
it's actually the simplest one!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.520
That's our Zonge-sama! You 
speak from experience!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.460
I just listen to my instincts, honed 
from long years of role-playing games!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:41.360
Why not use something other than the 
video game rule of thumb for once?

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.260
Why would I?

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:44.170
All right! Let's move!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:50.410
They're frozen through and through...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.140
They weren't wearing highly 
freeze-resistant arctic clothes.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.860
This wind is getting stronger...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.990
It's blowing at 30 meters per second.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.660
And the temperature's around -80 degrees.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.930
My breath freezes the moment I exhale...

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:27.070
I... I don't wanna... die in a place like...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.980
Dundra... I mean...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.620
Dundra...

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.190
How many takes does this make?!

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:41.820
Where's Toriko?!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.560
Thank goodness! If I'd been separated 
from Toriko in a place like this,

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.700
I don't know what would've happened!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.770
Toriko!!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:58.440
Bonbi?!

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.570
I'm Zonge!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.650
Show some spirit, Rum.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.720
A place like this, we can't...

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:13.890
Wha...?!

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:20.390
Is that a sastruga?!

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:26.530
Yeah. The surface of the snow, sculpted 
by the strong wind into sharp ridges...

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:31.740
The wind's breaking off the 
sastrugi and flinging 'em at us!

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:33.870
Be careful! There are gonna be more of 'em!

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:58.830
Komatsu!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.200
You saved me!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:23.450
We'll take a short break right around here.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.820
Knife!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:48.280
Can you drink? It'll warm you up a little.

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:50.850
Th-Thank you.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.320
It's delicious.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:17:59.150
I'm glad.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:01.920
You should have some too, Takimaru-san.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:06.160
No, I'm fine. Please, drink all of it.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:09.430
But you haven't had anything 
to eat all this time...

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:15.500
Gourmet Knights fast for a month... so 
he's gotta be used to an empty stomach.

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.610
I don't have any for you, old man.

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:21.280
Though there's enough for your men...

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.110
Please let them drink.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.510
What, like giving handouts to the poor?

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.250
Your halo is blinding, Gourmet Knight.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.950
And yet I think you stand 
out more than me, old man.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.920
Cut the "old man" crap.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.960
I'm still in my 20s.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.260
You're still in your 20s, old 
man?! You're kidding, right?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.660
It's true.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.660
Huh?

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:41.060
Where's Toriko-san?

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.330
He's up there.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.500
In the middle of this blizzard?

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.200
Toriko's been keeping watch 
up there since we got here.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:50.500
Keeping watch? For deadly beasts?

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.270
There's that, too...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.740
But it looks to me like he's on 
guard against something else...

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:59.150
Ice Hell...

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.780
Feels like this could become the most 
difficult situation I've ever been in.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.920
With this brutal environment...

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.350
Tough, savage creatures I've 
never encountered before...

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.420
And also...

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.060
That...

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.660
All right! Group 2, let's go!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.140
How long are you gonna sleep?

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.940
Wake up, Barry Gamon!

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:39.880
I just laid down for a little 
nap and got frozen up!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:44.220
What? Branch #5 Culinary Head, Bogie Woods...

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.030
You're "lodging" in a 
member of the Gourmet SP?

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:52.030
The eating champion I was lodging 
in at first proved to be too weak...

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.240
That's as far as you go!

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:07.540
You're done having the run of this ship!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.100
You took him down?

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.150
A Gourmet SP is at least a little better

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:44.510
than being housed in that pig!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:47.350
But anyway, Barry, where's the vice-chef?

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:48.950
Sleeping, probably.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.120
It's cold outside, so I guess he's inside...

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:58.760
I slept well.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.760
Tommyrod-sama!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.340
Next up is getting something to eat.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:14.180
Do you know where the Century Soup is, Bogie?

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:22.580
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.850
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:33.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:37.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:40.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:43.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:50.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:54.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:57.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:01.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:11.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:15.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:21.670
Gourmet News.

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:25.440
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:29.110
A warm drink that makes you feel 
nice and toasty to the bone.

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:30.380
It sounds wonderful, doesn't it?

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:32.950
And so! I'm going to recreate 
the taste of that drink

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:36.420
with a just-as-good substitute, a 
drink that's sweet, warm and soothing,

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:38.720
perfect for the cold season!

00:22:39.090 --> 00:22:41.290
We start with piping hot tea...

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:43.930
and melt vanilla ice cream in it...

00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:46.060
Then add just a little lemon...

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:53.000
It tastes like sweet sake!

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:54.440
I'm getting all warmed up!

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:57.410
In fact, I feel a little 
tipsy for some reason...

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:01.350
Even though sweet sake itself hardly 
contains any alcohol in the first place!

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:04.050
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.620
The motivations of those who seek the soup: Determination. Desire. Betrayal?

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:13.490
All within the depths of the snowstorm!

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.590
Hurry While It's Hot! A Survival Race on Ice!

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:18.680
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
